recommend keep-going next open-media rung: the uppercase companions to finish the Latin-1 capitals (A ring U+00C5, AE U+00C6, O stroke U+00D8, Eth U+00D0, Thorn U+00DE, Y acute U+00DD), then the open glyph atlas beyond 5x7. No custody gate touched -- no network, no key, no funds.
